## Revert Instructions

To remove SCS and restore your prior configuration:

### Step 1 — Remove SCS .claude additions

```
rm -f "{{USER_PROJECT_PATH}}/.claude/CLAUDE.md"
```

To remove the R-agents added by SCS (check `SuiteCascadeSystem-Revert/agents.bak/` for your
pre-install agent names and remove only the SCS-added files, or restore the full pre-install state):

```
# Restore pre-install agents from backup (if agents.bak present):
rm -rf "{{USER_PROJECT_PATH}}/.claude/agents/"
cp -R "{{BACKUP_AGENTS_PATH}}" "{{USER_PROJECT_PATH}}/.claude/agents/"
```

### Step 2 — Restore CLAUDE.md backup (if desired)

Your prior CLAUDE.md backup: `{{BACKUP_CLAUDE_MD_PATH}}`

```
# Copy backup to restore prior project-root CLAUDE.md (if you had one):
cp "{{USER_PROJECT_PATH}}/SuiteCascadeSystem-Revert/CLAUDE.md.bak" "{{USER_PROJECT_PATH}}/CLAUDE.md"
```

### Step 3 — Remove SCS Cascades scaffolding (optional)

The `{{CASCADES_DIR}}` directory contains SCS planning artifacts. You may retain it
(it is self-contained and does not affect Claude Code behavior if `.claude/CLAUDE.md` is removed)
or remove it:

```
rm -rf "{{CASCADES_DIR}}"
```

### Step 4 — Remove Suite 8 conversion output (if conversion was performed)

```
rm -rf "{{CONVERSION_DESTINATION}}"
```

### Step 5 — Remove this Revert directory

```
rm -rf "{{USER_PROJECT_PATH}}/SuiteCascadeSystem-Revert/"
rm -f "{{USER_PROJECT_PATH}}/SuiteCascadeSystem-Revert.md"
```

